# Garnet's ruling: removing a lore counter triggers no earlier chapter, and the chapter triggers again when the Saga gets
# more lore counters (CR 714.2b). Bot1's Song of Freyalise has 2 lore counters on turn 3; Garnet attacks and takes one
# (Song to 1, Garnet 3/3). On turn 5 the Saga gets its second lore counter again, so chapter II triggers a second time
# (Garnet taps for blue mana: the creature gains "{T}: Add one mana of any color"), and chapter III has not come: no
# +1/+1 counter from it (Garnet keeps exactly the one from the removal) and the Saga is still on the battlefield.

